  1. The entries that the audit kept word for word: the source lines from their chunk's corrections file, "History lines the tool cannot write" ("History lines for the entries kept word for word" in corrections-c8.md). P-52 and P-59 lost only a handle today (group 7), and P-67 was rewritten today by the clarity pilot, its meaning unchanged; their source lines still belong in their history. P-27, P-38, P-43 and P-90 are left out: they wait on his answers.
